    "excerpt": "Looking for the best car detailing in Bangalore? Learn what to check before you book: ceramic coating, PPF, warranty, products and process. By P91 Car Care, Adugodi.",
    "lede": "Search for the best car detailing in Bangalore and you get hundreds of options, from roadside car wash setups to premium studios. They all promise a showroom shine, but the results, and what you pay, vary a lot.",
